# A blank 20 MB disk: leave the creation of a Primary DOS Partition with
# Esc, at its first question and at the size. No partition is made, but
# the disk is not as it was: choosing to create the partition has FDISK
# test the tracks at the start of the free space by writing to them
# (verify_tracks), before the first question, as Microsoft's FDISK does.
# The master boot record is not written.
disk 21411840 615/4/17
expect table
expect sectors
wait A:\\>
type FDISK
key ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait make the partition active
key esc
screen menu
key 1 ret
wait Enter choice
key 1 ret
wait make the partition active
key n ret
wait Enter partition size
key esc
screen menu-again
key esc
wait A:\\>
quit
